00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:55.500
But the more I watched, the more I came to

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.180
the realization that Eromanga Sensei is a true masterpiece of our time.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.400
Now, understandably, you may be skeptical with words

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.120
like "Masterpiece" being thrown around a lot these days,

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.500
but I assure you, those of us who understand can attest

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.220
to everything that this show has been able to achieve.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.700
*creepy laugh*

