00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:39.280
*Did I mention the sister is not related by blood, 'cause that's really important*

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.960
Now, you may be asking yourself,

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.880
"How can such a series be considered a masterpiece?"

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:47.000
I mean, it just sounds like another super trashy show.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.980
This is a common misconception, as Eromanga Sensei isn't just a trashy show.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.940
High School DxD... is a trashy show.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.640
High School of the Dead... is a trashy show.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.380
Himouto! Umaru-chan... is a trashy show.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.160
Eromanga-sensei is something else.

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:10.300
It is... an enigma that transcends the limits of trash itself to become something beyond.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:15.060
A perfect car crash of garbage that takes the lowest common denominator

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.220
and divides that by zero.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:21.160
This isn't just trash, it's a full-on fucking landfill

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:25.020
and, in doing so, has become the ultimate work of art.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:29.400
Not all heroes wear capes, and not all art belongs in a gallery,

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:32.700
but if a urinal can be tastefully presented as an art piece,

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:34.160
then we must ask:

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:38.600
"Why can't we do the same with a loli saying, 'I love dick!'"

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:41.800
But, of course, not all art can be appreciated by everyone

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.660
which is why, to understand the full extent of this masterpiece,

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.460
one needs to fully accept who they really are.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:51.320
In Buddhism, it is said that "The root of all suffering is attachment,"

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:54.280
and Eromanga Sensei has a similar mantra about it.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:59.340
For, you see, it is this attachment you must first sever yourself from before you will be ready.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:03.380
Appreciation can only be achieved once you let go of everything.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:08.660
Self-esteem, shame, human decency, dignity, and any chance...

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.540
of your parents looking at you with pride.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:14.240
You must dedicate years of your life enveloped in the world of anime,

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.340
and I'm not talking about good, well-written shows...

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:21.000
Fanservice, glorious jiggling tits, uncomfortable fetishes,

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:25.480
adorable anime girls becoming one with the idea of panty-shots.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:29.040
Throw yourself off the deep end with no safety net to catch you,

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.960
as only once you have fully dedicated to this lifestyle

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.800
will you reach true enlightenment, and come to the realization

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:37.860
of the one, undeniable truth of this world...

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.380
Anime

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.040
Anime is

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.900
Anime is Trash

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.040
and so am I.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:46.440
You see, to fully comprehend trash, you must first become it,

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:49.660
and once you have reached this higher(lower?) plane of degeneracy

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.860
will you begin to realize the miracle that has befallen us here

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:56.040
because... this is beyond what everyone thinks it is.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:59.680
It's not really an incest show because they aren't related by blood

